# MOM's guard (docs/MOM.md §12): notices an app that runs away and shows it on
# the Living Diamond. It never closes anything. Turn it off in MOM → Startup.
[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=MOM guard
Name[he]=השומר של MOM
Comment=Notices apps that run away; never closes them
Comment[he]=שם לב לאפליקציות שיוצאות מכלל שליטה, ואף פעם לא סוגר אותן
Exec=dai-mom guard
TryExec=dai-mom
NoDisplay=true
X-GNOME-Autostart-enabled=true
